---
import Avatar from "./Avatar.astro";
import EmailCopy from "./EmailCopy.astro";
import ExternalLink from "./ExternalLink.astro";
---

<section aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="-ml-6 mb-3 w-fit reveal">
    <Avatar />
  </div>

  <h1 id="intro-title" class="mb-6 font-medium text-heading reveal">
    Hi, I’m Fadhil.
  </h1>

  <div class="page-copy reveal-list leading-[1.8]">
    <p class="reveal">
      I’m a design and full-stack engineer who likes building software and
      figuring things out. Right now, building &#32;
      <ExternalLink href="https://antonvideo.app"
        ><img
          src="/projects/anton.webp"
          alt=""
          width="16"
          height="16"
          class="mr-1 inline-block size-4 rounded-[4px] object-contain align-[-2px]"
        />Anton&nbsp;Video</ExternalLink
      >.<span class="hidden sm:inline"><br />
        &#32;You can also look through my other&#32;
        <a class="text-link" href="#projects">projects</a>,&#32;
        <a class="text-link" href="#ventures">ventures</a>, and past&#32;
        <a class="text-link" href="#experience">experience</a> here.</span>
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      Outside of work, I’m usually watching anime, reading manga, or freewriting
      on&#32;<ExternalLink href="https://hyfic.org/log-horizon/"
        ><img
          src="/projects/log-horizon.webp"
          alt=""
          width="16"
          height="16"
          class="mr-1 inline-block size-4 rounded-[4px] object-contain align-[-2px]"
        />Log&nbsp;Horizon</ExternalLink
      >.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      I’m also open to work. Say hello at <EmailCopy /><span class="hidden sm:inline">, or find other ways
      to&#32;<a class="text-link" href="#contact">get&nbsp;in&nbsp;touch</a></span>.
    </p>
  </div>
  <nav aria-label="On this page" class="reveal mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 text-[13px] sm:hidden">
    <a href="#projects" class="text-link inline-flex min-h-11 items-center">Projects</a>
    <a href="#experience" class="text-link inline-flex min-h-11 items-center">Experience</a>
    <a href="#ventures" class="text-link inline-flex min-h-11 items-center">Ventures</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="text-link inline-flex min-h-11 items-center">Get in touch</a>
  </nav>
</section>
